// ChannelService carries messages from a host to the server, and back.
//
// A host has topic spaces of its own: `PLUGIN/TOPIC` for what a feature
// publishes, and `user/ACCOUNT/TOPIC` for a person. Each message is kept as the
// publisher asks: not at all, only the last one, or a log bounded to 10,000 per
// topic. The server follows the channel from the sequence it last saw and
// publishes the messages into its own topics; box publishes and listens on the
